  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "West Lake fish is deceptively simple. The sauce has only four main flavours: ginger, vinegar, sugar, and soy. The fish is "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "poaching-fish"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "poached"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " rather than fried, which keeps it delicate. The finishing touch is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "cornflour-slurry"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "cornflour slurry"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " that thickens the sauce to a glossy coat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "If you can find "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "zhenjiang-vinegar"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Zhenjiang vinegar "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", use it. The flavour is more complex than rice vinegar alone. Do not substitute with Western malt vinegar, which is too harsh."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
